    fill: {type: solid, color: "$soft"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$blue3"}
  - elementId: bar-5t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [65, 366, 115, 34]
    content: {fontSize: 14, fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei", bold: true, color: "$navy", align: [left, middle], text: "IDC / 云服务"}
  - elementId: left-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [54, 425, 245, 56]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: |
        <p>条形长度仅表达系统影响和短期稀缺性的相对判断，不代表收入、利润率或估值。</p>
  - elementId: econ-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [330, 132, 576, 318]
    columnWidths: [0.23, 0.30, 0.47]
    rowHeights: [0.14, 0.172, 0.172, 0.172, 0.172, 0.172]
    style: "$researchTable"
    rows:
      - - text: "环节"
        - text: "收入模式"
        - text: "最应跟踪的变量"
      - - text: "芯片与生态"
        - text: "芯片、板卡、软件支持"
        - text: "供货、性能/功耗、编译器/算子、客户迁移成本"
      - - text: "互连与PCB"
        - text: "模块、交换机、板卡"
        - text: "400G/800G/1.6T代际、良率、客户结构与扩产"
      - - text: "供配电与液冷"
        - text: "设备销售 + 运维"
        - text: "单柜kW、液冷渗透、可靠性、PUE/WUE与存量改造"
      - - text: "服务器与集成"
        - text: "硬件、整柜、交付"
        - text: "集群效率、验收、部件转售占比、毛利与应收账款"
      - - text: "IDC / 云 / 调度"
        - text: "kW/MW、实例、Token"
        - text: "签约、利用率、价格、资本成本、续约与跨平台成交"
  - elementId: key-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [330, 468, 576, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: key-copy
    elementType: text
    bounds: [330, 476, 576, 26]
    content: {fontSize: 14, fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei", bold: true, color: "$navy", text: "服务器销售额常含部件转售；IDC价值取决于客户、利用率与融资成本。"}
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [54, 507, 822, 20]
    content:
      style: "$source"
      text: |
        <p>参考：<a href="https://www.caict.ac.cn/english/research/whitepapers/202509/P020250903609386521052.pdf">中国信通院《绿色算力发展研究报告（2025）》</a>；经济性判断为本报告归纳。</p>
  - elementId: page-no
    elementType: text
    bounds: [892, 507, 24, 18]
    content: {style: "$source", align: [right, top], text: "06"}
